        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana K4474, Colonial American Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid brass this 4\" center to center Colonial American style pull handle is great for cabinets, drawers, furniture, or small utility doors. Packaged complete with screws for easy installation. The simple beaded design makes it the perfect addition to any space, adding a chicness that is both classic and beautiful. It is available in 8 finishes, so you'll be able to find one to match your personal style.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-K4474-size.gif?v=1704354733\" width=\"501\" height=\"167\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana K4474 Colonial American Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:  <a href=\"/products/3-inch-colonial-american-cabinet-handle-deltana-k4473\"><b>3\" Colonial American Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana K4474 Colonial American Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 4\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/K4474.pdf?v=1704262256\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana K4474 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the cabinet handle will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>. \r\n</p>",
